// PAS-DEBT-B2-010c Slice C (#1542, v0.36.66) — `+` repetition fixture.
//
// `$( ... )+` requires at least one match. `nonempty(a, b)` should
// bind `$x` to `[a, b]` and expand to `first_is(a, b)`; an empty
// invocation `nonempty()` would fail cleanly at match time (the
// matcher returns Failed for `+` with zero iterations, and the
// caller sees M0308 no-matching-rule).
//
// End-to-end code-emission coverage waits on the macro-driver work
// (PAS-DEBT-B7-001, #1529).

module M = structure {
  macro nonempty($($x:expr),+) => { first_is($($x),+) }
}
